 "wording": {
  "primary_sentence": "Primary (H1: b < 0): with replicate fixed effects, the OLS slope of Y_id (ln failures per combo object on the in-distribution test set) on k = log8(N / 16) is b = -0.7566 per 8x step of N (95% CI [-1.1827, -0.3305]; one-sided p = 0.0030; df = 5; 9 runs in 3 complete replicate sets). R5 category (delta = 0.15): Exceeds the margin. Under the preregistered rule this slope is practically meaningful (its 90% CI lies entirely beyond the margin)."
 }
